{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「粵艇南下」今日起實施，首批有五艘遊艇來港，政府計算超級遊艇產業，市場價值在2032年會達到約3,500億港元，希望能分一杯羹。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201205-%E7%B2%B5%E8%89%87%E5%8D%97%E4%B8%8B%E7%95%B6%E5%B1%80%E5%B0%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E6%89%93%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E9%81%8A%E8%89%87%E6%A8%9E%E7%B4%90%E5%86%80%E6%96%BC%E8%B6%85%E7%B4%9A%E9%81%8A%E8%89%87%E7%94%A2%E6%A5%AD%E5%B8%82%E5%A0%B4%E5%88%86%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%AF%E7%BE%B9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>粵艇南下｜當局將本港打造成遊艇樞紐　冀於超級遊艇產業市場分一杯羹</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案。蔡天鳳丈夫譚方駿繼續作供。他憶述蔡天鳳遇害當日，曾向他發語音訊息，稱鄺家心地不好。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201191-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E8%AD%9A%E6%96%B9%E9%A7%BF%E6%86%B6%E8%BF%B0%E6%AD%BB%E8%80%85%E9%81%87%E5%AE%B3%E7%95%B6%E6%97%A5%E6%9B%BE%E7%99%BC%E8%AA%9E%E9%9F%B3%E8%A8%8A%E6%81%AF%E7%A8%B1%E9%84%BA%E5%AE%B6%E5%BF%83%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%A5%BD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜譚方駿憶述死者遇害當日曾發語音訊息　稱鄺家心地不好</strong></a></p><p></p><p>機電工程署巡查發現，有承辦商未有按要求，為觀塘翠屏北邨及沙田博康邨升降機安裝門框組件，並涉嫌提供虛假文件。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201152-%E5%B1%8B%E9%82%A8%E6%8F%9B%E5%8D%87%E9%99%8D%E6%A9%9F%E7%96%91%E6%AC%BA%E8%A9%90%E6%A1%88%E6%89%BF%E8%BE%A6%E5%95%86%E5%85%A5%E6%A8%99%E5%83%B9%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E6%9C%89%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E6%8C%87%E9%A9%97%E6%94%B6%E6%87%89%E7%94%B1%E8%A8%BB%E5%86%8A%E9%9B%BB%E6%A2%AF%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%B8%AB%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>屋邨換升降機疑欺詐案承辦商入標價最低　有專家指驗收應由註冊電梯工程師完成</strong></a></p><p></p><p>廉政公署起訴五人，涉嫌利用空殼公司，詐騙政府近200萬元「科技券」資助。他們被控串謀詐騙罪，早上在東區裁判法院提堂。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201157-%E5%BB%89%E7%BD%B2%E8%B5%B7%E8%A8%B4%E4%BA%94%E4%BA%BA%E6%B6%89%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E7%A9%BA%E6%AE%BC%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E8%A9%90%E9%A8%99%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E8%BF%912%E7%99%BE%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E5%88%B8%E8%B3%87%E5%8A%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>廉署起訴五人　涉利用空殼公司詐騙政府近2百萬元「科技券」資助</strong></a></p><p></p><p>警方正通緝一名男子，涉嫌掌摑兒子。據了解，警方仍正約見受害人，在成人陪同下錄取口供。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201158-10%E6%AD%B2%E7%94%B7%E7%AB%A5%E6%8B%92%E6%BA%AB%E7%BF%92%E9%81%AD%E7%88%B6%E6%8E%8C%E6%91%91%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E9%80%9A%E7%B7%9D53%E6%AD%B2%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>10歲男童拒溫習遭父掌摑　警方通緝53歲男子</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T12:19:50.026181+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":451,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T15:17:52.979892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T12:17:42.706398+00:00","content_hash":"08bf58b548bf636636a886742b432a410df423c502d8d7db50747389449bc304","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}